  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.6\n        - A bottom sheet keeps a scroller's explicit ScrollBarVisibility.Always. G9BottomSheetScrollBarPolicy hides the bar of\n        every scroller inside a sheet; it used to overwrite Always too, so a long menu could not say \"there is more below\".\n        The policy now replaces only the default, axis by axis; every other sheet scroller keeps its hidden bar.\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
